- !<Text/0a4c49c9-73a5-4f0c-8679-51da69331799>
  PrefabRemaps:
    []
  Name: Text
  Enabled: true
  RenderOrder: 11
  StretchMode: Stretch
  VerticalAlignment: Center
  HorizontalAlignment: Left
  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Video Call S2S connects two Specs wearers: each one sees a 4-digit code on the home panel, types the friend's code and taps CALL FRIEND; the friend accepts and both cameras and voices flow.
    In this Preview there is no Snap Cloud project, so CALL FRIEND opens the call panel with a synthetic test feed.
    Real calls need your own Snap Cloud project and two Specs devices.
  CustomMaterial: !<reference> 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
  Editable: false
  ShowEditingPreview: true
  TouchHandler: !<reference> 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
